# Allowlist for scripts/check-domain-terms.sh
# Format: path-glob|term|reason
# Only generic English uses may be listed here. Real Kubernetes/Helm/Azure/etc.
# domain concepts must be removed from the template, not allowlisted.
# One entry per path-glob and term; every entry needs a reason.

# "stack" as in "full stack" / "technology stack" / "stack trace" / "Docker stack"
.github/agents/devops-engineer.md|stack|"full stack" = whole docker compose stack (generic Docker usage)
.github/agents/orchestrator.md|stack|"full-stack feature" (generic English)
.github/agents/qa-engineer.md|stack|"full stack" / "Docker stack" (generic English)
.github/copilot-instructions.md|stack|"Full-stack app" / "Full stack (Docker)" (generic English)
.github/instructions/security.instructions.md|stack|"stack traces" (generic debugging term)
README.md|stack|"Full-Stack Application Template" (generic English)
WIKI.md|stack|"full-stack application template" (generic English)
frontend/e2e/*.spec.ts|stack|Template UI title "Full Stack Application" (generic English)
frontend/index.html|stack|Template page title "Full Stack Application" (generic English)
frontend/src/*|stack|Template UI title "Full Stack Application" (generic English)
